  "title": "MRMS Rainfall Measurements",
  "description": "Hourly gridded precipitation accumulation data for the contiguous United States derived from NOAA's Multi-Radar Multi-Sensor (MRMS) system, combining radar and rain gauge observations. Includes gauge-only, MultiSensor MultiPass, and derived precipitation rate products stored as a cloud-optimized Zarr/Icechunk array.",
